    <comment>English: Automatic: 4 ms at 115200 bps, 6 ms at 9600 bps (8N1). If a packet splits, increase the timeout or set FTDI Latency Timer to 2 ms in Device Manager and reconnect. A driver still at 16 ms may need a longer timeout.</comment>
